    "body": "the cons says:\r\n\r\n> one extra, **non blocking**, call before starting the ES2015 modules logic\r\n\r\nAFAIK modules are already non blocking, this would be a one off delay before the first module gets executed. Let's move the discussion in the other thread though.\r\n",
